      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NOLA KEEPING (2) boasts a strong record this journey here with eight wins and nine minors from 23 tries. Was out of the placings last time (31.16) at this track in a OPEN, finishing fifth and beaten 10 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. PAW PETROV (3) was a brilliant winner two back but last start drifted back and wound up strongly to finish a 6 length second at this track (30.88). Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Will give a great sight again. TRIO OF CLOWNS (1) was prominent throughout when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when 4th and beaten 8 lengths at this track (31.04). Boasts a strong record from this draw with six wins and five minor placings from 12 starts. Likely to be thereabouts. COMPTON GOLD (7) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
